  "story": {
    "title": "What Shall I Wear Today?",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "Do you ever feel like your clothes aren't quite right... ...that they're all too big or too small or too tight?",
      "Something is wrong with the buttons on this shirt. And these pants are so tight that they're starting to hurt.",
      "This skirt is much too long for me. And this top is too tight! Do you agree?",
      "My pants are too old. They need to be stitched. And these golden stars are making me itch.",
      "I think I'll try on these trousers instead. But they pull and tug and are hard to put on. What will I do? All my options are gone!",
      "How about this dress? No, I think it's too bright. What about my brother's stripy t-shirt? That would be a funny sight!",
      "Or how about my daddy 's jacket ? No, I think they would be much too long. I 'll try on my mother 's scarf instead. Oh no, I've put it on all wrong! I can't reach anything else on the washing line. So I'll have to find something else of mine.",
      "These clothes seem to say, \"We don’t want to agree\" But an idea is beginning to come to me.",
      "I'll mix and match to create my own style... ...so that finally I can relax and smile!"
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "Do you ever feel like your clothes aren't quite right...",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113609/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Con có bao giờ cảm thấy quần áo của mình không vừa ý không..."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "...that they're all too big or too small or too tight?",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113609/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "...chúng quá rộng, quá chật hay quá bó?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Something is wrong with the buttons on this shirt.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113609/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Có gì đó không ổn với cúc áo trên chiếc áo sơ mi này."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "And these pants are so tight that they're starting to hurt.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113609/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Và chiếc quần này chật đến nỗi bắt đầu làm đau rồi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "This skirt is much too long for me.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113609/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chiếc váy này quá dài so với con."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "And this top is too tight!",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113609/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Và chiếc áo này quá chật!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Do you agree?",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113609/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Con có đồng ý không?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "My pants are too old.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113609/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Quần của con cũ quá rồi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "They need to be stitched.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113609/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng cần được khâu lại."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "And these golden stars are making me itch.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113609/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Và những ngôi sao vàng này làm con ngứa."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I think I'll try on these trousers instead.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113609/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Con nghĩ con sẽ thử chiếc quần dài này thay vào đó."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "But they pull and tug and are hard to put on.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113609/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nhưng chúng cứ kéo và giật, khó mặc quá."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "What will I do?",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113609/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Con sẽ làm gì đây?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "All my options are gone!",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113609/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Hết lựa chọn rồi!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "How about this dress?",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113609/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Còn chiếc váy này thì sao?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "No, I think it's too bright.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113609/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Không, con nghĩ nó quá sáng."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "What about my brother's stripy t-shirt?",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113609/s_016.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Còn chiếc áo phông sọc của anh/em trai con thì sao?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "That would be a funny sight!",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113609/s_017.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Trông sẽ buồn cười lắm!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Or how about my daddy 's jacket ?",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113609/s_018.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Hay là chiếc áo khoác của bố con?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "No, I think they would be much too long.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113609/s_019.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Không, con nghĩ chúng sẽ quá dài."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I 'll try on my mother 's scarf instead.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113609/s_020.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Con sẽ thử chiếc khăn quàng của mẹ con thay vào đó."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Oh no, I've put it on all wrong!",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113609/s_021.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ôi không, con đã mặc nó sai rồi!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I can't reach anything else on the washing line.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113609/s_022.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Con không thể với tới thứ gì khác trên dây phơi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "So I'll have to find something else of mine.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113609/s_023.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Vậy nên con sẽ phải tìm thứ gì đó khác của mình."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "These clothes seem to say, \"We don’t want to agree\" But an idea is beginning to come to me.",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113609/s_024.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Những bộ quần áo này dường như nói rằng, \"Chúng tôi không muốn đồng ý\" Nhưng một ý tưởng đang bắt đầu nảy ra trong đầu con."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I'll mix and match to create my own style...",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113609/s_025.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Con sẽ phối đồ để tạo ra phong cách riêng của mình..."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "...so that finally I can relax and smile!",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_113609/s_026.mp3",
        "text_vi": "...để cuối cùng con có thể thư giãn và mỉm cười!"
      }
    ]
  },
